<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <title>404 - The Twisting Nether - Wowhead</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --border-width: 2px;
            --font-family-standard: "Open Sans", Arial, "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, sans-serif;
            --link-color: #ffd100;
            --link-color-hover: #fff;
            --wh-gray-1: #181818;
            --wh-gray-2: #202020;
            --wh-gray-3: #303030;
        }
        html, body {
            background: #000 url(https://wow.zamimg.com/images/nether/twisting-nether-bg.jpg) center / cover;
            color: #bbb;
            font: 24px var(--font-family-standard);
            height: 100%;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        body {align-items: center; display: flex; justify-content: center}
        section {
            background: var(--wh-gray-1);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px #000;
            border: var(--border-width) solid var(--wh-gray-3);
            border-radius: 10px;
            display: inline-block;
            position: relative;
        }
        section p {margin: 1em}
        a {color: var(--link-color); text-decoration: none}
        a:hover {color: var(--link-color-hover)}
        #logo {
            align-items: flex-end;
            bottom: calc(100% + var(--border-width));
            display: flex;
            height: 0;
            justify-content: center;
            left: 0;
            position: absolute;
            right: 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        #logo:before {
            background: url(https://wow.zamimg.com/images/logos/wh-logo.png) no-repeat bottom / contain;
            content: "";
            display: inline-block;
            height: 100px;
            width: 171px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<section>
    <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/" id="logo" aria-label="Wowhead logo linking to homepage"></a>
    <p>You find yourself in the Twisting Nether.</p>
    <p>You are likely to be eaten by a nathrezim.</p>
    <p><a href="https://www.wowhead.com/">Return to Wowhead</a></p>
</section>
</body>
</html>
